{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大标题，紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”“不自在了呢”最醒目；随后视线容易被中部白色大句和底部橙色大句吸引，三块都很突出。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"初步能看出他突然安静下来，担心对方以后不再需要自己陪伴，甚至不愿和自己相处；但具体处境需要结合两块文字才能确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、没底；同时能注意到一点高兴，但两种情绪的关系不够直观。\",\n  \"missed\": \"对方一直没有退开、两人眼下仍然亲近，这些现实依据其实让他感到高兴；这种现实中的亲近与对未来的担忧形成的反差，需要读底部整句才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方标题、中部白色大句、底部橙色大句。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：上方讲担心，中部讲突然安静，底部讲现实中的亲近和一点高兴，需要拼接才能理解处境与感受的关系。\",\n    \"单块标题较长，包含担忧的具体内容和假设情境，单看紫色强调词还不足以完整理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c83c1c9e-6362-491a-96ff-6d563355d17e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011325276265Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:14:01.789265+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7427d779da60717973fd44535ced219062da912b9f6e892bbbec2c5561753998", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sess